  "identifier": "virchow",
  "name": "Virchow",
  "description": "Self-supervised vision transformer (ViT-H/14, 632M parameters) pretrained on 1.5M whole-slide histopathology images from Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center using DINOv2. Tile-level feature extractor for computational pathology — used frozen or fine-tuned for cancer detection, subtyping, and rare cancer identification. Published in Nature Medicine 2024. Apache 2.0, 13k+ monthly HuggingFace downloads. Developed by Paige and Microsoft Research. Institutional email required for model access. See also Virchow2 (3.1M slides, CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0).",
  "url": "https://huggingface.co/paige-ai/Virchow",
  "codeRepository": "https://github.com/Paige-AI/paige-ml-sdk",
  "relatedLink": [
    "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41591-024-03141-0"
  ],
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
