    "cloud-only"
  ],
  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Apache 2.0 pathology foundation model trained on 1.5M MSK slides — one of the few major pathology FMs with a truly open licence. Nature Medicine 2024, Paige + Microsoft Research. 632M parameter ViT-H/14. Alongside Prov-GigaPath (also Apache 2.0), Virchow is recommended over the NC-licensed alternatives (UNI, CONCH, Virchow2) for teams building commercial or derivative pathology AI pipelines.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-14",
